{"Title":"An Act making appropriations for the fiscal year 2024 for the maintenance of the departments, boards, commissions, institutions, and certain activities of the Commonwealth, for interest, sinking fund, and serial bond requirements, and for certain permanent improvements","BillNumber":"H4040","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":null,"Name":"FY2024 General Appropriations ","Type":2,"Details":null,"ResponseDate":"2023-07-30T20:30:37.497"},"Cosponsors":[],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4040/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":null,"DocumentText":null,"EmergencyPreamble":"Whereas, The deferred operation of this act would tend to defeat its purpose, which is to which is immediately to make appropriations for the fiscal year beginning July 1, 2023, and to make certain changes in law, each of which is immediately necessary or appropriate to effectuate said appropriations or for other important public purposes, therefore it is hereby declared to be an emergency law, necessary for the immediate preservation of the public convenience.\r\n\r\n","RollCalls":[{"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Branch":"Senate","RollCallNumber":60,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Branches/Senate/RollCalls/60"},{"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Branch":"Senate","RollCallNumber":61,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Branches/Senate/RollCalls/61"},{"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Branch":"Senate","RollCallNumber":64,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Branches/Senate/RollCalls/64"},{"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Branch":"Senate","RollCallNumber":65,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Branches/Senate/RollCalls/65"},{"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Branch":"Senate","RollCallNumber":66,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Branches/Senate/RollCalls/66"},{"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Branch":"S